    "name": "A1v2 \u00b7 whisper ctrl, motor_gain=0.1",
    "description": "State-prior stage 5 (2026-08-31): the AUTHORITY BUDGET.  Measured: the alpha_stand scaffold balances this body with 0.0002 rad joint corrections, while every brain arm runs |u|~0.87 -> +-0.3 rad swings, 1500x louder \u2014 the brain's own storm is the perturbation that fells it, and the body never samples the near-standing regime the prior descends toward.  motor_gain becomes the budget: all learning stays live, the COMMANDS whisper.  THIS ARM: control (prior 0) at motor_gain 0.1 \u2014 separates \"quiet alone\" from \"quiet + prior\".",
